   660		// The runner uses that proof (review round 2, finding 5): a turn whose daemon has finished while the
   661		// chat still waits (an approval nobody gives) must make the run invalid, where the round-2 rule
   662		// (every response written, then a quiet screen) would have advanced as if the turn had ended.
   663		{
